  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Promocin de Estrategias Innovadoras para el Desarrollo Rural Sostenible y la Conservacin Ambiental</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of Innovative Strategies for Sustainable Rural Development and Environmental Conservation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo es implementar proyectos productivos sostenibles asociativos (agrcolas, pecuarios, forestales, pesqueros y acucolas) y de negocios verdes, ya estructurados, que tengan como propsito la promocin del desarrollo rural resiliente y bajo en carbono en Caquet, Putumayo y Nario</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to implement sustainable productive associative projects (agricultural, livestock, forestry, fishing and aquaculture) and sustainable businesses, already structured, whose purpose is the promotion of resilient and low carbon rural development in Caquet, Putumayo and Nario.</narrative>
  </description>
